### Day 06 - Employee Management API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7000
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/employees

### Get all employees (200 OK)
GET {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get employee by ID - Success (200 OK)
GET {{apiUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Get employee by ID - Not Found (404 Not Found)
GET {{apiUrl}}/999
Content-Type: application/json

### Create new employee - Success (201 Created)
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Johnson",
  "email": "alice.johnson@company.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567892",
  "department": "Marketing",
  "position": "Marketing Manager",
  "salary": 88000,
  "hireDate": "2023-03-15"
}

### Create new employee - Invalid Email (400 Bad Request)
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Bob",
  "lastName": "Wilson",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567893",
  "department": "Sales",
  "position": "Sales Representative",
  "salary": 65000
}

### Create new employee - Missing Required Fields (400 Bad Request)
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Charlie",
  "email": "charlie@company.com"
}

### Create new employee - Negative Salary (400 Bad Request)
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "David",
  "lastName": "Brown",
  "email": "david.brown@company.com",
  "department": "Finance",
  "position": "Accountant",
  "salary": -50000
}

### Create new employee - Duplicate Email (400 Bad Request)
POST {{apiUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Duplicate",
  "email": "john.doe@company.com",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "position": "Developer",
  "salary": 75000
}

### Update employee - Success (204 No Content)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe.updated@company.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "position": "Lead Developer",
  "salary": 105000,
  "isActive": true
}

### Update employee - Not Found (404 Not Found)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Nobody",
  "lastName": "Here",
  "email": "nobody@company.com",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "position": "Developer",
  "salary": 75000,
  "isActive": true
}

### Update employee - Invalid Data (400 Bad Request)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "J",
  "lastName": "S",
  "email": "invalid",
  "department": "HR",
  "position": "Manager",
  "salary": -1000,
  "isActive": true
}

### Delete employee - Success (204 No Content)
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/2

### Delete employee - Not Found (404 Not Found)
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/999
